\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Emergence of Mushroom House Berlin (2009)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 The business emerged gradually rather than strategically.\
Friends began requesting mushrooms. Small restaurant kitchens asked whether he could source additional quantities. Market visitors asked if he sold directly.\
Thomas slowly began organizing:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 supplier relationships,\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 transport methods,\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 storage systems,\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 and inventory tables.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The name \'93Mushroom House Berlin\'94 came later.\
The concept \'93Mushroom Mood Today\'94 was never originally designed as branding. It emerged naturally from Thomas\'92s habit of connecting:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 weather,\
